autowhisper (0.8.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Truth & foundations release (production plan M1) plus the companion.
    - Multilingual model catalog (incl. large-v3-turbo) with language=auto
      and SHA-256-verified, self-healing model downloads
    - Transcript pipeline: filler removal, personal dictionary
      ("spoken => written"), spoken commands (new line / new paragraph)
    - Echo, the floating companion: click-to-dictate button with live
      voice halo and state captions; forms echo/hermes/mnemosyne
    - Windows: real global hotkey (WH_KEYBOARD_LL), SendInput Unicode
      text injection and clipboard (closes #14)
    - X11 hotkey listener rewritten to the canonical sync XRecord
      pattern with bounded shutdown; settings-resume deadlock closed
    - Settings server hardened: per-session bearer token and loopback
      Host allowlist; config floats serialize as shortest round-trip
    - Neutral light/dark design system across settings UI and site;
      status-only motion with prefers-reduced-motion support
    - Benchmark harness (latency/RTF/WER); CI builds and uploads
      artifacts for Linux, macOS, and Windows on every push

 -- AutoWhisper Maintainers <maintainers@autowhisper.dev>  Fri, 12 Jun 2026 17:00:00 +0000

autowhisper (0.7.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * macOS port: first-class mac target via native frameworks
    - CGEventTap hotkey listener (listen-only)
    - CGEventPost text injection with Unicode/emoji support
    - NSStatusItem menu-bar tray (mic SF Symbol, template mode)
    - launchd LaunchAgent supervision (replaces systemd on mac)
    - CG Preflight APIs for Input Monitoring and Accessibility checks
    - AVCaptureDevice-backed microphone permission detection
    - NSMicrophoneUsageDescription in Info.plist
    - Metal inference auto-enabled via whisper.cpp (no config change)
    - LSUIElement .app bundle with hardened runtime signing, Developer ID
      timestamping, notarization, stapling, and Gatekeeper acceptance proof
    - Bundled config.toml fallback for double-clicked app launches outside the
      repository working directory
    - Finder/LaunchServices app launch defaults to foreground daemon behavior
    - Universal binary (arm64 + x86_64), deployment target macOS 12.0
  * Architectural seams for cross-platform support:
    - PlatformOutput interface (X11/macos/fake) replaces ifdef'd output
    - ServiceManager interface (systemd/launchd) replaces inline shell-out
    - Doctor split into common + per-platform checks with CheckResult
  * 16 new tests cover the OutputManager state machine (9 cases) and the
    macOS keycode-to-X11-canonical-name mapping (7 cases). 99 tests pass.
  * Docs: docs/MACOS.md user guide; TODOS.md for deferred follow-ups
    (Homebrew tap, DMG, Sparkle auto-update, Windows port).

